OL,3,AMan admits sexually assaulting woman
OL,4,Adrugged by husband
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe husband had already pleaded guilty
OL,7,Fto 60 offences against his wife but
OL,8,Falso admitted a fresh charge of rape
OL,9,Fand one of sexual assault today - both
OL,10,Foffences which occurred last summer.
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/40
