OL,3,ARoyal Mail plans to cut 2,500 jobs
OL,4,
OL,5,FRoyal Mail has announced plans to cut
OL,6,F2,500 head office and other supporting
OL,7,Froles by the end of 2027 as it battles
OL,8,Fcompetition and falling demand for
OL,9,Fletter deliveries.
OL,11,FThe cuts at the postal service will
OL,12,Frepresent about 2% of the
OL,13,F131,000-strong workforce.
OL,15,FHowever, frontline postal workers -
OL,16,Fposties and drivers - are not part of
OL,17,Fthe proposed restructuring.
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/40
