OL,3,ARoyal Mail plans to cut 2,500 jobs
OL,4,
OL,5,FRoyal Mail said the workforce
OL,6,Freduction, designed to improve
OL,7,Fefficiency, would be achieved through
OL,8,Fvoluntary redundancies and people
OL,9,Fchoosing to leave the company.
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/40
