OL,4,AHamas-led 7 October 2023 attacks
OL,5,
OL,6,FIsrael does not allow international
OL,7,Fnews organisations, including the BBC,
OL,8,Finto Gaza to report freely
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/40
