OL,3,AResidents of kibbutz destroyed in 7
OL,4,AOctober Hamas-led attacks grapple with
OL,5,Ahow to rebuild
OL,6,
OL,7,FRoosting birds now coo among the
OL,8,Fceiling tiles in the deserted dining
OL,9,Froom of Kibbutz Nir Oz, once the
OL,10,Fbustling heart of a close-knit,
OL,11,F400-strong Israeli community which was
OL,12,Fdevastated by the Hamas-led attacks on
OL,13,F7 October 2023.
OL,15,F"We used to come and see each other,
OL,16,Feat together. There were lots of
OL,17,Factivities here, also holidays to
OL,18,Fcelebrate," remembers Dalit Ram Aharon,
OL,19,Fwho is showing me around with her
OL,20,Fhusband, Achi.
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/40
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
